;; Replay stream generated by scripts/capture-to-replay.py
;; from a raw MOSES capture log (see experiments/memo-prototype/).
;;
;; Order and repetition are preserved exactly as captured -- NO
;; deduplication -- because repeated candidates are the cache-hit
;; signal the memo-prototype benchmark measures. Each atom carries
;; an explicit sequence index because `collapse`-ing a space does
;; not guarantee iteration order; the replay driver walks by index.
;;
;; The captured expressions are stored as INERT DATA, not wrapped
;; in `quote`: in this standalone prototype AND/OR/NOT are not
;; defined as functions/equations, so an unquoted (AND ...) /
;; (OR ...) / (NOT ...) atom simply fails to reduce to anything
;; else and is stored as-is -- quoting would just add a needless
;; wrapper the driver would have to strip on every read.

!(bind! &replayStream (new-space))
